.TH "GF-DASHBOARDS-DELETE-DASHBOARD-BY-UID" "1" "Jun 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-dashboards-delete-dashboard-by-uid - Deletes dashboard by uid


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf dashboards delete-dashboard-by-uid [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Deletes dashboard by uid

.PP
Will delete the dashboard given the specified unique identifier (uid).

.PP
Use: /apis/dashboards.grafana.app/v1/namespaces/{ns}/dashboards/{uid}

.PP
Response schema (DeleteDashboardByUIDOK.Payload):
  message  string  REQUIRED
                   Message Message of the deleted dashboard.
  title    string  REQUIRED
                   Title Title of the deleted dashboard.
  uid      string  REQUIRED
                   UID Identifier of the deleted dashboard.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--describe-response-jsonschema\fP[=false]
	Print the JSON Schema of the response payload and exit without calling the API

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete-dashboard-by-uid

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	Print the raw HTTP response body instead of the decoded payload

.PP
\fB--uid\fP=""
	UID [required]


